										<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label4"><font face="Verdana" size="1">Wizard strikes!</font></span></P>
									<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Date:
										<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label2"><font face="Verdana" size="1">8/6/2003 10:48:52 PM</font></span></P>
									<P>
										<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label1"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><P><IMG height=190 src="/pics/2/wizard4.gif" width=134 border=0 align="left"> This dude is dangerous!</P></font></span></P>
								</td>
		</tr><tr>
			<td>
