			<td align="Center">
									<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Title:&nbsp;
										<span id="dl_news__ctl4_Label4"><font face="Verdana" size="1">Hello Boy..... </font></span></P>
									<P style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">Date:
										<span id="dl_news__ctl4_Label2"><font face="Verdana" size="1">11/18/2002 7:40:00 AM</font></span></P>
									<P>
										<span id="dl_news__ctl4_Label1"><font face="Verdana" size="1">Klandicar Round 2...<BR><BR>FIGHT!<BR><IMG src="http://home.mchsi.com/~serendipitousexistence/KlanCorpse.jpg"><BR>Get on the ground you ugly ass clown.<BR><BR>Gratz Wopa on our first sleepers key awarding. Gratz Pyrain on Peerless BP.<BR><BR>Also killed Vindicator again like clockwork. Gratz Panegyvver on your boots.<BR><BR>later<BR><BR>-sani <BR><BR></font></span></P>
